s:mb-4\"><div style=\"background-color:#EF444415;color:#EF4444\" class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d w-12 h-12 xs:w-14 xs:h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 rounded-xl xs:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 text-xl xs:text-2xl sm:text-3xl bg-gray-200 animate-pulse rounded\"></div></div></div><h3 class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d text-base xs:text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 xs:mb-3 text-center leading-tight transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-gray-800\">Sit Back and Relax</h3><div class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d mb-3 xs:mb-4 flex-grow\"><p class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d text-gray-600 text-xs xs:text-sm sm:text-sm md:text-base text-center leading-relaxed\">Once you&#x27;re on the schedule, you can sit back and relax. Our all-inclusive lighting services mean you don&#x27;t have to do a single thing. Installations take 3-8 hours depending on home size, and we handle takedown and storage after the holiday season.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d space-y-1.5 xs:space-y-2 mt-auto pt-2 xs:pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d flex items-start gap-1.5 xs:gap-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1\"><div style=\"background-color:#EF444415\" class=\"jsx-d6e667b11dfb5e8d flex-shrink-0 w-4 h-4 xs:w-4 xs:h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" class=\"text-sm text-xs transition-all duration-300 group-hover:rotate-12\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"color:#EF4444\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.05