px]\"><div class=\"text-gray-600\">Loading testimonials...</div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 py-24 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-center font-montserrat text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-20\"><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 via-amber-500 to-emerald-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Questions &amp; Answers</span></h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-300 shadow-xl\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 bg-red-600\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"text-white text-lg transition-transform duration-300 rotate-45\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-8 py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-red-600\">What services are included with professional Christmas light installation?</h3></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out\" style=\"height:0px\"><div class=\"pl-24 pr-8 pb-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">Our professional installation includes custom lighting design tailored to your home or business, all Christmas lights and décor provided and professionally installed, ongoing maintenance throughout the holiday season, full takedown after the season ends, and all lights removed and stored at our facility — no storage required on your end.</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-300 shadow-sm\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-900\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"text-white text-lg transition-transform duration-300 \" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-8 py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-gray-900\">What kind of lights do you install?</h3></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out\" style=\"height:0px\"><div class=\"pl-24 pr-8 pb-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">We install two types of lighting: Seasonal Lighting – commercial-grade C9 LED bulbs that are 3x brighter than anything you&#x27;ll find at a big-box store, with every display custom-fit to your home. Permanent Lighting – Invisilights permanent lighting systems.</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-300 shadow-sm\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-900\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"text-white text-lg transition-transform duration-300 \" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-8 py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-gray-900\">Am I buying the lights?</h3></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out\" style=\"height:0px\"><div class=\"pl-24 pr-8 pb-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">● Seasonal Lighting - No. All seasonal lights and décor are leased and maintained by our team, so you never have to worry about repairs, storage, or climbing ladders. If anything needs attention during the season, we handle it. ● Permanent Lighting – Yes. Permanent lighting systems are purchased and professionally installed on your home.</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-300 shadow-sm\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-900\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"text-white text-lg transition-transform duration-300 \" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-8 py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-gray-900\">Do you install the lights I own?</h3></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out\" style=\"height:0px\"><div class=\"pl-24 pr-8 pb-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">We don&#x27;t — and here&#x27;s why: we use professional-grade Christmas lighting on every project so we can guarantee quality, safety, and reliability all season long.</div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-300 shadow-sm\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 shrink-0 transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-900\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"text-white text-lg transition-transform duration-300 \" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"px-8 py-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-gray-900\">Are any discounts available?</h3></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out\" style=\"height:0px\"><div class=\"pl-24 pr-8 pb-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base\">Yes, we offer discounts for installations completed before November, as well as loyalty discounts for continuous years of service.</div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white py-4 px-3 xs:px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center min-h-[400px]\"><div class=\"text-gray-600\">Loading quote form...</div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-dark-navy border-t border-holiday-red/30 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center min-h-[200px]\"><div class=\"text-white text-base px-4\">Loading footer...</div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/033g87j5nlof8.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__ne